7. Use @EnableGlobalMethodSecurity(prePostEnabled=true) to enable method-level security.
8. Implement custom user details service to load user information from database or other source.
9. Use JWT token as stateless bearer token instead of default session-based token for stateless REST API.
10. Set up SSL/TLS encryption for secure communication between clients and servers.

